        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, while many of our G&A costs are expected to scale with the size of our business (for example, as the number of policyholders increases, customer support and cloud hosting costs may rise), we do not believe that growing our business or the number of policies we sell will require any material changes to our cost structure.",
        "start_character": 51506,
        "end_character": 51841
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As an MGA, we operate within a highly regulated industry, subject to state and federal laws governing various aspects of our business.",
        "start_character": 72257,
        "end_character": 72391
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2024, we launched an excess flood insurance product designed to address a critical gap in coverage for policyholders who remain with the NFIP.",
        "start_character": 52270,
        "end_character": 52415
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Unlike traditional admitted carriers, we operate on an Excess and Surplus (“E&S”) lines basis, which provides greater flexibility in underwriting, pricing, and product offerings.",
        "start_character": 72392,
        "end_character": 72570
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe this gap in flood insurance coverage, together with the limited designation of SFHAs, creates significant financial vulnerabilities for millions of American home and business owners and lenders and presents a substantial opportunity for innovative private-sector insurance solutions like Neptune.",
        "start_character": 16793,
        "end_character": 17100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed a portfolio of proprietary technologies, algorithms, and data models that are critical to our operations and growth strategy.",
        "start_character": 67882,
        "end_character": 68025
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a range of innovative insurance products designed to address the needs of residential and commercial property owners facing flood and other natural disaster risks.",
        "start_character": 39044,
        "end_character": 39216
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate nationwide and actively mitigate our concentration risk by expanding and diversifying our portfolio across the country.",
        "start_character": 43035,
        "end_character": 43165
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our innovative primary flood product and rapidly growing excess flood offering, we are well-equipped to serve both residential and commercial property owners, providing them with comprehensive and affordable coverage.",
        "start_character": 52865,
        "end_character": 53087
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With over a quarter billion dollars in paid claims across our portfolio since inception, and our extensive analysis of industry claims and performance data, we have developed deep insights into identifying and managing properties with the highest probability of flood losses.",
        "start_character": 24451,
        "end_character": 24726
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Early-Mover Advantage in a Large, Evolving Market Dominated by the NFIP: As the first entrant in the private flood insurance market with substantial scale and geographic presence, we have accumulated proprietary datasets through our operations that continuously improve our predictive technology, designed innovative products that we believe better suit evolving customer demand, and developed an extensive distribution network with trusted relationships that ensures broad reach across the market.",
        "start_character": 45734,
        "end_character": 46233
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002067129-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002067129-26-000007-416396d32a173d79",
        "accession_number": "0002067129-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Expansion of Product Offerings: We have continued to innovate and broaden our product offerings to capitalize on market trends and growth opportunities.",
        "start_character": 52116,
        "end_character": 52269
      }
